<div class="form" style="max-width:1000px">
    <h2 style="font-size:24px">@EditorState.AppTitle</h2>
    <div class="accent" style="font-size:22px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:24px">@EditorState.Credit</div>
    <p style="font-size:15px">
        A free save editor for Sword Art Online: Fatal Bullet saves (decrypted PS4 saves and PC saves).<br />
        It is free and always will be. If you paid for this editor or for an edited save, you were ripped off.
    </p>
    <h2>Credits</h2>
    <table style="width:auto">
        <tr><td class="accent"><b>@EditorState.Author</b></td><td>created the editor and mapped the save format</td><td></td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>alfizari</b></td><td>save signature key, item and chip name lists (Apache-2.0)</td><td><a href="https://github.com/alfizari/Sword-Art-Online-FB-Inventory-Editor" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com</a></td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Blazor WebAssembly / .NET 8</b></td><td>runs the editor in your browser</td><td><a href="https://dotnet.microsoft.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">dotnet.microsoft.com</a></td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Sword Art Online: Fatal Bullet</b></td><td>the game, by Dimps and Bandai Namco</td><td></td></tr>
    </table>
    <p class="note" style="margin-top:24px">
        This is a fan-made tool. It is not made, approved or supported by Bandai Namco or Dimps.
    </p>
</div>
